#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:69
#: b45cde06e22e409f96d27c8ddb8b5225
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:71
#: b81b37772a9e43fd848b71d61ad76655
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the RX1 (UART1_RX) pin. It supports all serial RC "
"protocols."
msgstr "RC 输入配置在 RX1（UART1_RX）引脚上，支持所有串行 RC 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:73
#: 8cc840235a114f328f085c9bcbecb93e
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` is set to \"23\" by default, and:"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:75
#: 7f3d2883caeb411592b97b53e88e0c96
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:77
#: 94ef71530fff4afaa44c755326379eea
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX1 pin, but SBUS requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 RX1 引脚，但 SBUS 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` "
"设置为「3」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:79
#: 76e7863de2c94496a3a8baa5f684b855
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX1 and :ref:`SERIAL7_OPTIONS<SERIAL7_OPTIONS>`"
" be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需连接到 TX1，并将 :ref:`SERIAL7_OPTIONS<SERIAL7_OPTIONS>` 设置为「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:81
#: 7ee7c677e6d8418b87b93e0c2cde65de
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX1 connection, in addition to RX1, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL7_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除 RX1 外还需要 TX1 连接，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL7_OPTIONS>` "
"设置为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:83
#: 25dc70402b29461c8e82949972b60d0e
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX1 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接 TX1 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:85
#: ed72df7602d34ec78684b02c1791eae3
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任意 UART 也可用于 RC 系统连接，与除 PPM 外的所有协议兼容。详情见 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:88
#: 76490f2376c64f67ab121f9f7e302b87
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:90
#: 543a542f5eda469298509e5b880bb0e7
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using any UART TX pin. You need to set the "
"following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT (example given for "
"UART5)"
msgstr "任意 UART TX 引脚均支持 FrSky 数传。需设置以下参数以启用 FrSky S.PORT 支持（以 UART5 为例）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:92
#: ba12e58ef105498d9a85c0a7b26dfc26
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:93
#: 4801a8cb71744050a0251a91d7bae655
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` = 7"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` = 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:96
#: d29a900653ff4de1bec9e9df6c9592dd
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:98
#: 2b642d221f524ffeafa54635a97678c6
msgid ""
"The MambaH743v4 supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver)."
msgstr "MambaH743v4 支持使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:101
#: 44e1ba779ffa43e587de08dcad4c9664
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:103
#: cbe62331010240be8fe3f64c9a514f3b
msgid ""
"The MambaH743v4 supports up to 9 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output M1 "
"to M8 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate pads, plus "
"M9 on a separate pad for LED strip or another PWM output."
msgstr ""
"MambaH743v4 最多支持 9 路 PWM 输出。电机输出 M1~M8 的焊盘同时提供在电机连接器和独立焊盘上，M9 在独立焊盘上，可用于 LED"
" 灯带或其他 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:105
#: 49513db075704a3ba1ffabfd358c9239
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:107
#: f2d999683a8c4ca7a892ef6d8bceb042
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-4 在组1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:108
#: 002ab3246cc54d8d8cdc9dc14fe2b3c1
msgid "PWM 5,6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5、6 在组2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:109
#: 0072984063274f1eb8a2579dff5a2da5
msgid "PWM 7,8 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7、8 在组3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:110
#: bbf3dbbbaa564a3ea2d15af742fd592b
msgid "PWM 9 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 9 在组4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:112
#: 9c44f07cbf8b4b89ac6601b1a250f30e
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-8 support bi-directional DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出频率。若某通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。通道 1-8 支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:114
#: 6a3fdf19c2844c28bb81f2559aa7689e
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从 BetaflightX 四轴迁移的用户，前四路输出 M1-M4 已通过以下默认参数配置，可与现有电机接线兼容："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:116
#: 79a61de1099744be921ecf8bb2fd8650
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:117
#: 8bd11122d72942ee97371f45fcd1bb2e
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:121
#: a8e6df4d3e4b48ffbb3768d5d47196dc
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:123
#: 273b157350b94ec1b98b1b8f9ae3fa4f
msgid ""
"The board does not have a built-in current sensor. The voltage sensor can "
"handle up to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该板没有内置电流传感器。电压传感器最高支持 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:125
#: 9c5272267d2345cda3cddce75f3bf387
msgid "Typical battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "典型电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:127
#: 4f8c4ba4ba3442bcbb85a6665c6a781b
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:128
#: 0cf905e4d9c1430291a3a35664f9126e
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:129
#: 51bfd96a60204c4bbaa69eaabcca9603
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:130
#: 160d540391814ad69d264dd5f6e27431
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.1"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:131
#: 773a2e1aced04caa85761657873d2116
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 64 (will "
"depend on external current sensor)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = "
"64（取决于外部电流传感器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:134
#: 5e790553ffd44220a04df79a82b83a5e
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:136
#: be196b2758a14710afb280dfddf1e32d
msgid ""
"The MambaH743v4 does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "MambaH743v4 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘使用 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:139
#: 30bf9667460d4d48a2f47f7b9a007bd9
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:141
#: 13c71780b93e49b1ba6f92c415871208
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled "
"\"MambaH743v4\"\"."
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在 `这里 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 找到，位于标有「MambaH743v4」的子文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:144
#: a6073f0639b24d9e91d8e0f7c4d082d3
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:146
#: fb59f7a248004cb98de2a5854db80202
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"初始固件可通过 DFU 方式加载：在按住引导程序按钮的同时插入 USB，然后使用您喜爱的 DFU 烧录工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:150
#: 4c26de4983304ead8d8af31ce63e5f5c
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Later updates should be done with the "
"\\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任何 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。后续更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
